                        "glosses": [
                            "церк. высший коллегиальный орган по делам русской православной церкви (учреждённый Петром I вместо упразднённого им патриаршества)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d6e5fdd9-d16a-3d0d-b11a-cf7339a3bd74",
                        "entry_id": "77f8f775-4725-3b3c-a437-8fc9ee23b65b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "церк. совещательный орган при главах католической и некоторых православных церквей, состоящий из высших церковных чинов, иерархов"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "848be4e8-935a-367d-ba5a-4cc064e55ac8",
                        "entry_id": "77f8f775-4725-3b3c-a437-8fc9ee23b65b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "собрание духовных и светских лиц для разрешения важнейших церковных дел протестантской церкви"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "24191b1a-0297-4143-8610-fbda7a95e7fe",
                        "source_entry_id": "77f8f775-4725-3b3c-a437-8fc9ee23b65b",
                        "target_lang_word": "synod",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "synod",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bfc26830-4918-3c88-bfd2-c05e12b1dc60",
                                        "entry_id": "663e8b43-fd60-34c5-bfdd-ed32a27e495f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An ecclesiastic council or meeting to consult on church matters."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "599dbe80-ce8c-4492-9d19-7957b575d7e4",
                                                "sense_id": "bfc26830-4918-3c88-bfd2-c05e12b1dc60",
                                                "text": "Addressing a number of previously taboo topics, this synod could result in several liberalizing reforms, though there is no guarantee that it will produce anything at all."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9dc1fb71-83e7-3868-aec5-0e457ab56420",
                                        "entry_id": "663e8b43-fd60-34c5-bfdd-ed32a27e495f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An administrative division of churches, either the entire denomination, as in the Lutheran Church–Missouri Synod, or a mid-level division (middle judicatory, district) as in the Evangelical Lutheran Church in America"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "43fb3ffd-64ef-384f-a3c5-5f4a0d3fffcd",
                                        "entry_id": "663e8b43-fd60-34c5-bfdd-ed32a27e495f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An assembly or council having civil authority (formal); a legislative body."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "490f1d20-8db0-48e1-af75-2d7558cdf58f",
                                                "sense_id": "43fb3ffd-64ef-384f-a3c5-5f4a0d3fffcd",
                                                "text": "It hath in solemn synods been decreed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8aa69ef-a833-4206-8ba7-b4e1a1e91de7",
                                                "sense_id": "43fb3ffd-64ef-384f-a3c5-5f4a0d3fffcd",
                                                "text": "A third part of the Gods, in synod met / Their deities to assert; who, while they feel / Vigour divine within them, can allow / Omnipotence to none."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4bda46c0-e121-44b1-a9bf-189c365dc7a7",
                                                "sense_id": "43fb3ffd-64ef-384f-a3c5-5f4a0d3fffcd",
                                                "text": "Parent of Gods and Men, propitious Jove! / And you bright ſynod of the Pow'rs above; / On this my ſon your gracious gifts beſtow; / Grant him to live, and great in arms to grow, [...]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f1e47079-f889-36c1-8d33-6354da80e44c",
                                        "entry_id": "663e8b43-fd60-34c5-bfdd-ed32a27e495f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A conjunction of two or more of the heavenly bodies."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "80763b53-15db-4fb8-a22d-b80eaf497e9a",
                        "source_entry_id": "77f8f775-4725-3b3c-a437-8fc9ee23b65b",
                        "target_lang_word": "convocation",
